<title>USA: Iowa-So Minn hogs actual Friday 82,000 - USDA.</title>
<headline>Iowa-So Minn hogs actual Friday 82,000 - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>DES MOINES 1997-08-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Actual interior Iowa and southern Minnesota hog receipts Friday were 82,000 head, compared with the estimate of 85,000, USDA reported. Saturday's actual receipts were 10,000 head, compared with the estimate of 5,000.</p>
<p>Opening trade not well established.  Early sales Barrows and Gilts were firm-up $0.50 per cwt than midsession Friday.</p>
